  "description": "TUNPUQ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C71 H55 Gd5 N16 O22,3(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.747-4.505 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.62-138.84°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd5(L)2(CH3COO)5(CH3OH)(μ3-OH)(μ2-OH)(H2O)]·3CH3OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
